  "editorial_flags": [
    "The first fragment uses the project's working term «Управление охраны Лунмэня» for 近卫局 and «Цензор» for 监察司; maintain consistency during the later literary pass.",
    "The phrase 归属感 at CN line 74 is rendered as «чувство принадлежности»; verify its nuance in the final dialogue edit.",
    "CN line 186 distinguishes 神民 and 先民; Russian uses «Старшие» and «Древние», following the Russian Arknights Wiki terminology. Keep these race labels consistent in later chapters.",
    "CN line 190 uses 平视 figuratively: the Russian draft renders the intended equal treatment / equal footing, not a literal physical gaze.",
    "CN line 193 compresses the image of FrostNova's final struggle into one sentence; the Russian draft preserves the sense, but this line merits a literary pass.",
    "CN line 279 雷霆手段 is rendered as «беспощадны его методы»; the phrase can also be read as forceful or brutal methods and merits literary review.",
    "CN line 271 不送 is a conventional refusal to see the departing guest out; Russian uses «Не стану вас провожать».",
    "CN line 333 诱敌深入 describes luring the enemy deeper into the city; the draft renders it as «тактика заманивания противника вглубь».",
    "CN lines 352–354 frame an 'Infected side' of Rhodes Island, which Amiya explicitly rejects; the Russian draft preserves this contrast as «направление заражённых».",
    "CN line 406 explicitly says 围棋 (Go), while EN Yostar says chess. The Russian draft follows CN; the generic metaphor «игровые фигуры» at line 404 is retained to avoid importing the English chess-specific 'pawns'.",
    "CN line 438 uses 陈警司, a police rank rendered as «суперинтендант Чэнь» following EN Yostar; verify the Russian rank wording during the final terminology pass."
  ],
